      "titleZh": "启用两个设置使我们在ARC-AGI-3基准上的得分提高了三倍",
      "titleEn": "How enabling two settings tripled our scores on the ARC-AGI-3 benchmark",
      "summaryZh": "通过调整两个API设置，GPT-5.6在ARC-AGI-3基准上的性能显著提升，得分和效率均大幅提高。具体方法包括保留推理轨迹和启用压缩功能。",
      "summaryEn": "By adjusting two API settings, GPT-5.6's performance on the ARC-AGI-3 benchmark improved significantly, boosting scores and efficiency. The methods include retaining reasoning traces and enabling compaction.",
      "keywords": [
        "ARC-AGI-3",
        "GPT-5.6",
